+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/claims/{claimId}/shares — share a claim with another person on the sheet (body:
+# {"personId":3,"share":"33.33"}): they hold that percent of its due, and CLAIM_SHARED is written. 422 for anything
+# refused (the claim's own person, a person already holding a share, a share not more than 0.00, shares adding up to
+# more than 100.00, or a SETTLED, VOID or DELETED claim); nothing is stored. 404 for a claim not on the sheet.
